       <!-- Fans & Sensors section (SSO-15377): DS §3 header + DS §2 elevated
            card, same recipe as System/Processor/Graphics/Memory/Battery
            (a seventh named override — see the style.qss rationale comment
            above #HardwareInfoPage #sectionHeaderAccentSystem). Lists fan
            RPMs (existing FanInfo/hwmon fan*_input) plus every hwmon temp
            sensor (ThermalInfo/hwmon temp*_input, including DIMM/NVMe once
            labeled) in one table; rows for sensors the platform doesn't
            expose are simply never added, never shown as zero/error. -->
       <item>
        <widget class="QWidget" name="sectionHeaderRowFans" native="true">
         <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="sectionHeaderRowFansLayout">
          <property name="leftMargin"><number>2</number></property>
